**Thursday 8 October 2026** · 90 minutes · D3A 4.0 2026, room to be announced.

Shared HPC only pays off when researchers can get their work done on it. This session puts HPC
providers and researchers in the same room to name the frictions that are in the way, and to
investigate where agentic GenAI opens new possibilities.

